{"page":419,"verses":[{"verse_key":"33:7","surah":33,"ayah":7,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذْ أَخَذْنَا مِنَ ٱلنَّبِيِّـۧنَ مِيثَـٰقَهُمْ وَمِنكَ وَمِن نُّوحٍ وَإِبْرَٰهِيمَ وَمُوسَىٰ وَعِيسَى ٱبْنِ مَرْيَمَ ۖ وَأَخَذْنَا مِنْهُم مِّيثَـٰقًا غَلِيظًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We took a solemn pledge from the prophets- from you [Muhammad], from Noah, from Abraham, from Moses, from Jesus, son of Mary- We took a solemn pledge from all of them:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذْ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idh","verse_key":"33:7"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَخَذْنَا","en_gloss":"We took","transliteration":"akhadhnā","verse_key":"33:7"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"33:7"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلنَّبِيِّـۧنَ","en_gloss":"the Prophets","transliteration":"l-nabiyīna","verse_key":"33:7"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِيثَـٰقَهُمْ","en_gloss":"their Covenant","transliteration":"mīthāqahum","verse_key":"33:7"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمِنكَ","en_gloss":"and from you","transliteration":"waminka","verse_key":"33:7"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَمِن","en_gloss":"and from","transliteration":"wamin","verse_key":"33:7"},{"pos":8,"ar":"نُّوحٍۢ","en_gloss":"Nuh","transliteration":"nūḥin","verse_key":"33:7"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَإِبْرَٰهِيمَ","en_gloss":"and Ibrahim","transliteration":"wa-ib'rāhīma","verse_key":"33:7"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَمُوسَىٰ","en_gloss":"and Musa","transliteration":"wamūsā","verse_key":"33:7"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَعِيسَى","en_gloss":"and Isa","transliteration":"waʿīsā","verse_key":"33:7"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱبْنِ","en_gloss":"son","transliteration":"ib'ni","verse_key":"33:7"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مَرْيَمَ ۖ","en_gloss":"(of) Maryam","transliteration":"maryama","verse_key":"33:7"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَأَخَذْنَا","en_gloss":"And We took","transliteration":"wa-akhadhnā","verse_key":"33:7"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِنْهُم","en_gloss":"from them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"33:7"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مِّيثَـٰقًا","en_gloss":"a covenant","transliteration":"mīthāqan","verse_key":"33:7"},{"pos":17,"ar":"غَلِيظًۭا","en_gloss":"strong","transliteration":"ghalīẓan","verse_key":"33:7"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٧","en_gloss":"(7)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"33:7"}]},{"verse_key":"33:8","surah":33,"ayah":8,"ar_uthmani":"لِّيَسْـَٔلَ ٱلصَّـٰدِقِينَ عَن صِدْقِهِمْ ۚ وَأَعَدَّ لِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ عَذَابًا أَلِيمًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God will question [even] the truthful about their sincerity, and for those who reject the truth He has prepared a painful torment.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لِّيَسْـَٔلَ","en_gloss":"That He may ask","transliteration":"liyasala","verse_key":"33:8"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰدِقِينَ","en_gloss":"the truthful","transliteration":"l-ṣādiqīna","verse_key":"33:8"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"about","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"33:8"},{"pos":4,"ar":"صِدْقِهِمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"their truth","transliteration":"ṣid'qihim","verse_key":"33:8"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَأَعَدَّ","en_gloss":"And He has prepared","transliteration":"wa-aʿadda","verse_key":"33:8"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_gloss":"for the disbelievers","transliteration":"lil'kāfirīna","verse_key":"33:8"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَذَابًا","en_gloss":"a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhāban","verse_key":"33:8"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَلِيمًۭا","en_gloss":"painful","transliteration":"alīman","verse_key":"33:8"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٨","en_gloss":"(8)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"33:8"}]},{"verse_key":"33:9","surah":33,"ayah":9,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ ٱذْكُرُوا۟ نِعْمَةَ ٱللَّهِ عَلَيْكُمْ إِذْ جَآءَتْكُمْ جُنُودٌ فَأَرْسَلْنَا عَلَيْهِمْ رِيحًا وَجُنُودًا لَّمْ تَرَوْهَا ۚ وَكَانَ ٱللَّهُ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ بَصِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You who believe, remember God’s goodness to you when mighty armies massed against you: We sent a violent wind and invisible forces against them. God sees all that you do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"33:9"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"wh